  {
   "id": "denshattack-361826@major-2026-09-17",
   "gameId": "denshattack-361826",
   "displayName": "Leaderboard Update + Train Colours and Skins! 🎨",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-17T12:59:52.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hi Denshattackers! 😁",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re here to give you the latest exciting updates! First we want to shout out that we’re at the Tokyo Game Show. If you’re around come find us at Hall 4, C08!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/2b7b24295b6876edb97fb4b369cc6071cc012ff5.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🥇Online Leaderboards (PC)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have the most heavily requested feature from the community added to Denshattack! Online Leaderboards on PC, accessible from:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "World Map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Pause Menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "End Level Screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/ce174fa474265e609b21a9a011c96e1844212e43.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Select any stage from the World Map and hit Y to open up a rankings list, where you can compete for supremacy in a few different categories.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Score: Highest Points on a Run (Uncapped)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Time: Fastest Completion (Uncapped)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Gold Time Score: This board only takes your highest score that ALSO qualifies for a Gold medal time - so no loops or infinite exploits here, just pure 100% execution. Unlike the other two (which will upload your highest existing results automatically), this one only counts runs from this patch onwards.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "This is our first iteration of Leaderboards so we are expecting to deploy patches fixing any potential exploits or bugs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎨More Train Colours",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Your trains can be customised EVEN MORE with extra colour palettes across all trains in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/2716a2b7a5b0c858ffbe9f7b205c4bc01e2c5174.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🚅New Streamer Skins",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve got even more ways to ride your train in style, with new Streamer Skins available to unlock! Keep an eye on their socials and streams to find out the code!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/df3471cd21d36fabea94e636f6d1faf0088ecd2f.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[table equalcells=\"1\" colwidth=\",\"][p align=\"center\"]❤️Creators",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"center\"]📽️Stream Channel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Zentreya ⚡🐲⚔️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitch Channel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mint Fantome 👻✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Victoria Roman 👁️🌂",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Phoebe Chan 🐝🌸",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mint YouTube",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Victoria YouTube",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Phoebe Twitch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "MysticLight🌙✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitch Channel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🗼Tokyo Game Show Event Skin Pack",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "And to celebrate TGS, we've added a brand new event skin pack, available now to unlock from any castle! Unlock code: ⬅️⬆️➡️⬇️⬇️➡️⬆️⬅️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/b3214e730c03efeb7d817bde6ef5f6ba7191b4fa.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⏱️Millisecond Timer",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "For the speed runners and time-attack enthusiasts (we see you): a new millisecond-precision timer is now available as a settings option, for when tenths of a second just isn't enough. 😉",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "By activating the Detailed Timer option in the Settings menu, you'll be able to see your time up to the millisecond during gameplay and on the different menus.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/7c513e68396773d899c5c18a44580279a82ae7fd.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for the continued love and hype for Denshattack! Please do share your thoughts, fan art, comments or feedback in our Discord (listed below) and tag us on social media! 😁",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "📢 Keep up to date with the Latest News!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Join the rebels on TikTok, X, BlueSky and Reddit!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sign up to our Newsletter!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks for riding with us and catch you on the rails (if we’re fast enough!) 😁",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
