  {
   "id": "denshattack-361826@major-2026-08-20",
   "gameId": "denshattack-361826",
   "displayName": "The Platinum Update - Out Now! 🎖️",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-20T13:50:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Konnichiwa(こんにちは) Denshattackers!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A small but fun update has JUST pulled into the station on all platforms, and is bringing you some fresh new ways to show off those skills of yours. Here’s the breakdown of the update:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🏆Platinum Medals",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Have you mastered every level? Now’s your chance to go even further with Platinum Medals. They are now available on each level for you to unlock and mark the true grit of your reputation as the best Denshattacker! This is for those of you who wish to push beyond Gold & chase completion on every track.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/12b72b287c8a11063f42012653caad025cf28652.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🚆New Unlockable Train",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Go Platinum with every single level and you’ll unlock a brand-new train as your reward. A great way to showcase that you have conquered the tracks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎬Cutscene Rewatch",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Missed a story beat or just want to relive your favourite moments with Emi and the crew without scouring the map? You’ll now be able to rewatch any cutscene you’ve unlocked, straight from the game screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/a5e27662f36c28ad7e582eb1ef47b6c4da9922ce.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "💛A Huge Thank You!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you so much for ALL of your amazing support since we launched, we have been blown away by your love for Denshattack!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "98% Overwhelmingly Positive on Steam!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "88 on Metacritic!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Absolutely speechless! And if you are at Gamescom next week, Denshattack! will be there too so please find us and say hi! 👋🏻",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Always feel free drop our thoughts, fan art, comments or feedback in our Discord (listed below) and tag us on any social media as we L O V E hearing from you. 😁",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Make sure to keep an eye out for more updates coming down the line...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "📢 Keep up to date with the Latest News!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Join the rebels on TikTok, X, BlueSky and Reddit!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sign up to our Newsletter!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
