  {
   "id": "denshattack-361826@major-2026-06-04",
   "gameId": "denshattack-361826",
   "displayName": "Launch Date Update + Japanese Voice Acting Reveal!🎙️",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-04T14:59:59.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello Denshattackers!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re bringing you some news about our launch; we’re moving our launch date from 17th of June to 15th of July. Whilst we pride ourselves on being the “only” trains that are on time, sometimes delays can happen so we appreciate your patience and continued support and hype around Denshattack!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That being said, this delay allows us to focus on a couple of things that matter to you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎯What we’re focusing on",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "During development sometimes more bugs may appear and we want to dedicate time to really squash these before you get your hands on the game. This ensures that you have the smoothest and best experience possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stable Framerate Work",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We want to make sure both Steam Deck and Console players get the best experience and that’s why we are taking time to strive for 60 FPS across all platforms.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎙️Full Japanese Voice Acting",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're really excited to share that Denshattack! will have Japanese voice over! You'll also be able to play in with your preferred language subtitles with Japanese dub, and you can switch between voice over at any point throughout the game! We know this was a heavily requested feature, so we're really pleased to be able to include this in Denshattack!.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Meet three of our Japanese voice actors",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/20f211f078f4ce4818266d9a312320a9196580cc.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/eda249a9dd089b9895ab9d4c08431a609c546339.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45746608/c32b0cded9c227aa7013b126d408f4e6dec6224e.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "👋🏻That’s all folks!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In case you missed it, we have a list of improvements in one of our recent news posts to see some of the work we’re busy implementing behind the scenes to bring you a great gameplay experience at the new launch date.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A reminder again that launch is 15th of July, 2026. We will come back to share the full launch timing details and more information closer to launch!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "📢 Keep up to date with the Latest News!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Join the rebels on TikTok, X, BlueSky and Reddit!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sign up to our Newsletter!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mata ne/またね,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🚅 The Denshattack! Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
